KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ direct-list-initialization: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ from the prvalue: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
